RESEARCH SOFTWARE NOTICE — NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE
================================================================================

`linac-forensics` is Research Software — NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE.

It has NOT been cleared, approved, or certified by the U.S. Food and Drug
Administration (FDA), European Union Medical Device Regulation (EU MDR / CE),
Health Canada, or any other regulatory authority for clinical diagnosis,
treatment planning, patient-specific quality assurance sign-off, linac
calibration, or radiation therapy delivery decisions.

All clinical radiation therapy machine QA, patient-specific IMRT/VMAT QA,
and linear accelerator service actions MUST be performed using clinically
commissioned, regulatorily cleared systems under the direct supervision of
a Qualified Medical Physicist (QMP) in accordance with institutional protocols
and applicable AAPM Task Group reports (e.g., TG-100, TG-142, TG-218).
